OL,3,ANetanyahu says pilot arrested after
OL,4,Astabbing another pilot and apparently
OL,5,Atrying to crash Israel-bound plane
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnother passenger says "we took control
OL,8,Fof the flight" from "an assailant with
OL,9,Fa knife" - meanwhile, two other pilots,
OL,10,Fsitting at the back, reportedly came
OL,11,Fforward to land the plane
OL,13,FNetanyahu says the pilot who launched
OL,14,Fthe attack has been arrested and is
OL,15,Fbeing questioned by Saudi authorities -
OL,16,Fan Israeli ambassador says the other
OL,17,Fpilot is from the UAE
OL,19,FNetanyahu also "salutes the heroes" who
OL,20,Fhelped "stabilise the aircraft", saying
OL,21,Fthey "saved many lives and prevented a
OL,22,Fmajor disaster"
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
