OL,3,ALast UK and US troops leave Iraq as
OL,4,Aanti-Islamic State mission ends
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish and US forces have been present
OL,7,Fin Iraq since 2014, as part of the
OL,8,Finternational coalition to help defeat
OL,9,Fthe extremist Islamic State (IS) group.
OL,10,FTheir departure brings the mission,
OL,11,Fknown as Operation Inherent Resolve, to
OL,12,Fan end.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
